# An Ulcerous Uragnite (abyssea 178): a level 99 Warrior in North Gustaberg by the Cavernous Maw 2 with The Truth
# Beckons completed and Dawn of Death accepted (GMs), no Traverser Stone, 8 maw quests completed (A Goldstruck Gigas, To
# Paste a Peiste, Megadrile Menace, The Beast of Bastore, A Delectable Demon, A Fluttery Fiend, A Beaked Blusterer, A
# Man-eating Mite) (GMs). The maw, no stone: no section: its own warp event 908 (entranceMawOnTrigger), finished on
# option 0: no warp. Traverser Stone 3 (a GM, one stone: `>= 1`): 0 (a Progress), finished on option 0: begun. Back to
# available (a GM): the maw again with no other talk between: 0 again (an Event-rank 0 would alternate with the maw's
# own onTrigger: 908), finished on option 2: begun (any option). Accepted: the maw: no handler: 908. A zone-in, accepted
# with no Amphitrite title: nothing. The title (a GM): the zone-in plays 1 (left open); its update on option 0 and on
# option 2: nothing; on option 1: updateEvent(the key item for 8 completed: Ivory Abyssite of Destiny); finished: Ivory
# Abyssite of Destiny given, then completed. Completed (title, stone and Dawn of Death still held): a zone-in: nothing;
# the maw: 908.
lists NorthGustaberg/Cavernous_Maw_2/onTrigger NorthGustaberg/onEventFinish/0 NorthGustaberg/onEventFinish/908 NorthGustaberg/onZoneIn/1 NorthGustaberg/onEventUpdate/1 NorthGustaberg/onEventFinish/1
char zone=NorthGustaberg pos=-76.5,-0.5,600 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath accepted
quest Abyssea.AGoldstruckGigas completed
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste completed
quest Abyssea.MegadrileMenace completed
quest Abyssea.TheBeastOfBastore completed
quest Abyssea.ADelectableDemon completed
quest Abyssea.AFlutteryFiend completed
quest Abyssea.ABeakedBlusterer completed
quest Abyssea.AManEatingMite completed
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw_2                 # no stone: no section: the maw's warp event 908
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
keyitem TraverserStone3                 # a GM: one stone
trigger Cavernous_Maw_2                 # available, one stone, Dawn of Death accepted: 0
finish                                  # option 0: begun
quest Abyssea.AnUlcerousUragnite available # a GM
trigger Cavernous_Maw_2                 # 0 again (the kind)
finish option=2                         # begun (any option)
trigger Cavernous_Maw_2                 # accepted: no maw handler: 908
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
rezone                                  # accepted, no title: nothing
title AmphitriteShucker                 # a GM
rezone open                             # the title: 1, left open
update 1 option=0                       # option 0: nothing
update 1 option=2                       # option 2: nothing
update 1 option=1                       # option 1: updateEvent(Ivory Abyssite of Destiny)
finish                                  # Ivory Abyssite of Destiny given; completed
rezone                                  # completed: nothing
trigger Cavernous_Maw_2                 # completed: no section: 908
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
